<</Parent 69 0 R/Next 9 0 R/Prev 7 0 R/Title(III. Look in, let not either the proper quality, or the true worth of anything pass thee, before thou hast fully apprehended it.)/Dest 1367 0 R>>
endobj
9 0 obj
<</Parent 69 0 R/Next 10 0 R/Prev 8 0 R/Title(V. The best kind of revenge is, not to become like unto them.)/Dest 1368 0 R>>
endobj
