<</Parent 69 0 R/Next 11 0 R/Prev 9 0 R/Title(VI. Let this be thy only joy, and thy only comfort, from one sociable kind action without intermission to pass unto another, God being ever in thy mind.)/Dest 1369 0 R>>
endobj
